! TUFLOW FV
##IF feature:tutorial##
##COMMANDS tutorial_model_activate##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! COORDINATE REFERENCE FRAME
! Cartesian (Eastings and Northings) model in metric units
GIS FORMAT == ${gis_format}											! {MIF} | SHP
##IF ${gis_format}:SHP##
SHP Projection == ..\model\gis\projection.shp						! Projection string used for GIS integration
##ENDIF##
##IF ${gis_format}:MIF##
MI Projection == ..\model\gis\projection.mif						! Projection string used for GIS integration
##ENDIF##
Units == ${units}															! {Metric} | US Customary | Imperial | English        
Spherical == ${spherical}											! {0} Cartesian | 1 Spherical
##IF spherical:0##
Latitude == ${latitude}												! {0.0} Representative latitude for study area
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:salinity##
##COMMANDS fvc_salinity##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:temp##
##COMMANDS fvc_temperature##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:temp##
##COMMANDS fvc_heat##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:ad##
##COMMANDS fvc_ntracer##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:stm##
##COMMANDS fvc_include_sediment##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! HARDWARE (optional)
Hardware == ${hardware}

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! SPATIAL ORDER (optional)
Spatial Order == ${spatial_order}

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! SIMULATION TIME SETTINGS
Time Format == ${time_format}								! {HOURS} | ISODATE
Start Time == ${start_time}														! Simulation start time (dd/mm/yyyy hh:mm:ss)
End Time == ${end_time}															! Simulation end time (dd/mm/yyyy hh:mm:ss)
##IF feature:events##
##COMMANDS events_fvc##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! COMPUTATIONAL TIMESTEP
CFL == ${cfl}																! {1.0} Courant stability criterion
Timestep Limits == ${timestep_limits}											! {0.0} Minimum model timestep (s), {0.0} Maximum model timestep (s)

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! WETTING AND DRYING (optional)
! Set to default {1.e-5} Dry depth (m), {1.e-2} Wet depth (m)

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! BOTTOM DRAG
Bottom Drag Model == ${bottom_drag_model}											! {Manning} | ks
Global Bottom Roughness == ${glob_bottom_rough}										! {1.0E-6} Manning's 'n' 

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! HORIZONTAL MIXING
! Turbulence
Momentum Mixing Model == ${momenutim_mixing_model}									! None | Constant | Smagorinsky | Wu
Global Horizontal Eddy Viscosity == ${glob_horiz_eddy_visc}									! {0.0} Smagorinksy coefficient
Global Horizontal Eddy Viscosity Limits == ${glob_horz_eddy_visc_lims}					! {0.0} Minimum eddy viscosity (m^2/s), {99999.} Maximum eddy viscosity (m^2/s)

##IF feature:3d##
!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! VERTICAL MIXING
##COMMANDS fvc_3d_mixing##
##ENDIF##

##IF feature:ad##
!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! TRACER DEFINITION
##COMMANDS fvc_tracer_block##
##COMMANDS fvc_tracer_block_params##
End Tracer
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:stm##
##COMMANDS fvc_sediment_control_file##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:wqm##
##COMMANDS fvc_wq_control_file##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:ptm##
##COMMANDS fvc_particle_tracking_control_file##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! WIND STRESS (optional)
! Default wind stress model and parameter adopted

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! COMPUTATIONAL MESH
! Unstructured
Geometry 2D == ${geometry_2d}

##IF feature:3d##
!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! VERTICAL MESH GEOMETRY
##COMMANDS fvc_3d_geometry##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! BATHYMETRY 
! Bathymetry is assigned within mesh 2dm file

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! INITIAL CONDITIONS
Initial Water Level == ${iwl}
##IF feature:salinity##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_salinity##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:temp##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_temp##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:ad##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_tracer##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:st##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_sediment##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:wq##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_wq##
##ENDIF##
##IF feature:wqm##
##COMMANDS fvc_initial_wq##
##ENDIF##

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! MATERIALS
! Example Material
Material == 1															! {0} Material ID
  Bottom Roughness == 0.018								! Manning's 'n' roughness coefficient
End Material

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! BOUNDARY CONDITIONS
Read GIS Nodestring == <path/to/2d_ns.shp>

! Example BC Block
BC == WL, 2, ..\bc_dbase\<wl_boundary.csv>
    BC Header == time, WL
    ##IF module:ad##
    ##COMMANDS tracer_bc_header##
    ##ENDIF##
    ##IF module:stm##
    ##COMMANDS sediment_bc_header##
    ##ENDIF##
    ##IF module:wqm##
    ##COMMANDS wq_bc_header##
    ##ENDIF##
End BC

!__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
! MODEL OUTPUTS
Output Dir == ..\results												! Result output directory
Log Dir == log															! Log and diagnostics directory
Write Check Files == ..\check											! Directory for GIS check files
